OVERVIEW: Execute a DICOM workflow script

USAGE: dicom-script run <script-path> [--variables <variables> ...] [--parallel] [--verbose] [--dry-run] [--log <log>]

ARGUMENTS:
  <script-path>           Script file path

OPTIONS:
  --variables <variables> Variables in KEY=VALUE format
  --parallel              Enable parallel execution where possible
  -v, --verbose           Show verbose output
  --dry-run               Dry run - show what would be executed
  --log <log>             Log file path
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

